{"summary":"Tramp, Granny, Bandit & Devil","description":"PLAY THE BEGINNING FOR FREE. IN-APP PURCHASE THE FULL GAME.\n\nPilgrims is a playful adventure game. Roam the land as you please and make new friends, share a laugh with your fellow travelers and help them complete their little stories, your way. How many different solutions can you find?\n \n It is most enjoyable if you’re into:\n - Playfulness: Don’t beat it - play with it! Solve the various tasks using dozens of items and unique characters without being obliged to follow a single designated path.\n - Replayability: Packed with 45 achievements, Pilgrims is a game designed to be played through more than just once. Can you collect them all?\n - Hand-crafted appeal: Hundreds of unique animations and custom made sound effects result in countless humorous and unexpected outcomes. Try to discover as many as you can!\n - Original music: Floex is back at it with his mix of live instruments and organic electronics, joined by guests on guitar or clarinet.","esrbNotes":"Mild Fantasy Violence, Comic Mischief, Use of Alcohol","pegiNotes":"Mild Violence, Implied Violence","iapPrices":"$2.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/6ExU_QJ-21g?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/nfMoiPc4_2fp2xPYls3vte06qHIqUoyi47Fg_w0EHqIOLdrJHfoTtbgptNzXfOYWN2phf1xSng2i8UdJqnUYBv0","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/g-Db4QVHGPWtosJwjT3yovRGvmAHRfEGKLasKA9vG_J27S1xCYWSWds8y5C12_WeZYB2Vq5vVA7j_iyyei-gOfw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/47zUgBJo-rNTG_NGlVNQ-vy1lVoNmYWtLGeulFIuDT3XfY-4CIChWVzFDFA4EB_cvQMBvq0xGUQIYsukgmfeLg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/4DFI4DnDsfdbJwx6dw_-OU3tuY2P3rNdIS84NSEBcTZut5RXmziGFcQX4VY7dAgVmV83Lx5gXonYC0rG0Ad0","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/G8wqBZX1ts-5pL_20p-5aWRAdz90RdcLdPZiv-2km7OGvenDwfxCvj3-F275jCaqcuY1B_326E6o9WhexAalCHQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/N01NFkjFlTw6x_LyarBp8UC-ilVWk8Jt4CyZpZgrRXmC9oAL